<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Technihire cautions it still in talks.</title>
<headline>Technihire cautions it still in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technihire Ltd said on Thursday talks were still in progress which could impact on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their dealings until a further announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
